    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Prayer for Jerusalem"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A song of ascents. Of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I rejoiced with those who said to me,",
          "“Let’s go to the house of the Lord.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Our feet were standing",
          "within your gates, Jerusalem —"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jerusalem, built as a city should be,",
          "solidly united,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "where the tribes, the Lord’s tribes, go up",
          "to give thanks to the name of the Lord.",
          "(This is an ordinance for Israel. )"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There, thrones for judgment are placed,",
          "thrones of the house of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Pray for the well-being of Jerusalem:",
          "“May those who love you be secure;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "may there be peace within your walls,",
          "security within your fortresses.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Because of my brothers and friends,",
          "I will say, “May peace be in you.” ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Because of the house of the Lord our God,",
          "I will pursue your prosperity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
